---
// Protocolo Pipod - Estética Apple Premium
// REGLA: Copy 100% original, sin resúmenes ni omisiones.
---

<section class="pipod-protocolo-section">
  <div class="pipod-container">
    <div class="pipod-header-area">
      <h2 class="pipod-protocolo-title">El Protocolo Pipod</h2>
      <p class="pipod-protocolo-subtitle">Reduce la fricción y explica la seguridad del servicio</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="pipod-protocolo-grid">
      <div class="pipod-step-card">
        <div class="pipod-card-inner">
          <div class="pipod-step-badge">1</div>
          <div class="pipod-step-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="pipod-step-title">DIAGNÓSTICO</h3>
          <p class="pipod-step-description">Revisión técnica exhaustiva sin costo inicial.</p>
          
          <ul class="pipod-step-list">
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Pruebas de hardware</li>
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Análisis de software</li>
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Medición de temperaturas</li>
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Identif. exacta del problema</li>
          </ul>

          <div class="pipod-step-footer">
            <div class="pipod-meta-row">
              <span class="pipod-meta-label">Tiempo:</span>
              <span class="pipod-meta-value">30-45 minutos</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pipod-meta-row">
              <span class="pipod-meta-label">Costo:</span>
              <span class="pipod-meta-value highlighted-text">GRATIS</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pipod-step-card">
        <div class="pipod-card-inner">
          <div class="pipod-step-badge">2</div>
          <div class="pipod-step-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="pipod-step-title">PRESUPUESTO</h3>
          <p class="pipod-step-description">Recibes el valor exacto y el tiempo de entrega. TÚ AUTORIZAS.</p>
          
          <ul class="pipod-step-list">
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Precio transparente</li>
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Tiempo de reparación</li>
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Tipo de repuesto</li>
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Garantía incluida</li>
          </ul>

          <div class="pipod-step-footer">
            <div class="pipod-meta-row">
              <span class="pipod-meta-label">Válido por:</span>
              <span class="pipod-meta-value">7 días</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pipod-meta-row">
              <span class="pipod-meta-label">Compromiso:</span>
              <span class="pipod-meta-value">Cero sorpresas</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pipod-step-card">
        <div class="pipod-card-inner">
          <div class="pipod-step-badge">3</div>
          <div class="pipod-step-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="pipod-step-title">ENTREGA</h3>
          <p class="pipod-step-description">Reparación certificada con 12 meses de respaldo.</p>
          
          <ul class="pipod-step-list">
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Trabajo técnico experto</li>
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Componentes original/certificado</li>
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Pruebas finales exhaustivas</li>
            <li><span class="dot-check"></span> Garantía 12 meses en papel</li>
          </ul>

          <div class="pipod-step-footer">
            <div class="pipod-meta-row">
              <span class="pipod-meta-label">Garantía:</span>
              <span class="pipod-meta-value">REAL (no marketing)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pipod-meta-row">
              <span class="pipod-meta-label">Cobertura:</span>
              <span class="pipod-meta-value">Defectos técnicos</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap');

  .pipod-protocolo-section {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 100px 0;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .pipod-container {
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 80px;
  }

  .pipod-header-area {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .pipod-protocolo-title {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #000;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .pipod-protocolo-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #666;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .pipod-protocolo-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 992px) {
    .pipod-protocolo-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .pipod-step-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 0.85px solid #000000;
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 40px;
    position: relative;
    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .pipod-step-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  }

  .pipod-step-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 24px;
    right: 24px;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    background: #000;
    color: #FFF;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .pipod-step-icon {
    color: #000;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .pipod-step-title {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #000;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .pipod-step-description {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    min-height: 3rem;
  }

  .pipod-step-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 32px 0;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .pipod-step-list li {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #444;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .dot-check {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background-color: #000;
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .pipod-step-footer {
    border-top: 0.5px solid #E5E5E5;
    padding-top: 24px;
  }

  .pipod-meta-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .pipod-meta-label {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #999;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .pipod-meta-value {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #000;
  }

  .highlighted-text {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .pipod-container {
      padding: 0 24px;
    }
    .pipod-step-card {
      padding: 30px;
    }
  }
</style>